<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <title>Report not released yet</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
               background: #F9FAFB; color: #111827; margin: 0; padding: 24px; line-height: 1.55; }
        .card { max-width: 34rem; margin: 8vh auto 0; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
                border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 1.5rem; }
        h1 { font-size: 1.125rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
        p { margin: 0.5rem 0; font-size: 0.9375rem; color: #374151; }
        .muted { color: #6B7280; font-size: 0.8125rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
    <h1>{{ term.name }} results are not released yet</h1>
    <p>
        {{ student.firstName }}'s report card for {{ term.name }} is still going through
        the school's approval. It becomes available once the year group's results are
        released — usually a few days after the term ends.
    </p>
    <p class="muted">
        Nothing is missing from your account. If a term has ended and this message is
        still here, ask the school office to release the results.
    </p>
    {% if school %}
        <p class="muted">{{ school.name }}</p>
    {% endif %}
</div>
</body>
</html>
